// RUN: cd %corpus && ! %zomc compile --check 05-statements/method_body_invalid_comparison_neg_01.zom > %t 2>&1
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --input-file %t

// The same refusal inside a method body rather than a free function. An owner is
// required to build a diagnostic's recovery root, and the owner lookup once
// admitted only DefinitionKind::Function, so every owner-scoped checker
// diagnostic fell through to a compiler incident inside a method.

// CHECK-LITERAL: Error [ZOM4029]: Comparison operator `!=` is not defined for types `i32` and `i64`
// CHECK-LITERAL:   --> conformance/05-statements/method_body_invalid_comparison_neg_01.zom:2:40
